sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    actor User as Authorized User
    participant UI as Web Portal / Mobile App
    participant ProductAPI as ProductsController
    participant Catalog as CatalogService
    participant CatalogStore as CatalogStore
    participant ReportAPI as ReportsController
    participant Report as ReportService
    participant ReportStore as ReportStore
    participant DB as PostgreSQL Database

    %% ==========================================
    %% 1. VIEW PRODUCT CATALOG
    %% ==========================================

    alt View Product Catalog

        User->>+UI: Open Product Catalog

        UI->>+ProductAPI: List(search, category, filters)
        ProductAPI->>+Catalog: ListProductsAsync(filters)

        Catalog->>+CatalogStore: ListProductsAsync(filters)
        CatalogStore->>+DB: SELECT products, categories and prices
        DB-->>CatalogStore: Product records
        deactivate DB

        CatalogStore-->>Catalog: Product list
        deactivate CatalogStore

        Catalog-->>ProductAPI: Filtered Product results
        deactivate Catalog

        ProductAPI-->>UI: Product catalog response
        deactivate ProductAPI

        UI-->>User: Display available products and prices
        deactivate UI

    %% ==========================================
    %% 2. VIEW BEST-SELLING PRODUCTS
    %% ==========================================

    else View Best-Selling Products

        User->>+UI: Open Best-Selling Products and select period

        UI->>+ReportAPI: BestSellingProducts(period, filters)
        ReportAPI->>+Report: GetProductRankingAsync(query)

        Report->>+ReportStore: Retrieve authorized sales scope
        ReportStore->>+DB: SELECT permitted regions and sales groups
        DB-->>ReportStore: Authorized scope
        deactivate DB

        ReportStore-->>Report: Scope information
        deactivate ReportStore

        alt Valid period and authorized scope

            Report->>+ReportStore: AggregateProductSalesAsync(period, scope)

            ReportStore->>+DB: SELECT delivered quantities and net revenue by SKU
            DB-->>ReportStore: Aggregated sales data
            deactivate DB

            ReportStore-->>Report: Product sales summary
            deactivate ReportStore

            Note right of Report: Rank by quantity, net revenue, then SKU

            Report-->>ReportAPI: ProductRankingResult

        else Invalid period or unauthorized scope

            Report-->>ReportAPI: Validation or forbidden error

        end

        deactivate Report

        ReportAPI-->>UI: Ranking result or error
        deactivate ReportAPI

        UI-->>User: Display best-selling products or error
        deactivate UI

    end